en.use:
Use to assess the clinical or pathological stage group for endometrial cancer. 

The guideline maps the individual TNM components to the overall prognostic stage:

stage I: T1, N0, M0;

stage IA: T1a, N0, M0;

stage IB: T1b, N0, M0;

stage II: T2, N0, M0;

stage III: T3, N0, M0;

stage IIIA: T3a, N0, M0;

stage IIIB: T3b, N0, M0;

stage IIIC1:T1-T3, N1/N1mi/N1a, M0;

stage IIIC2: T1-T3, N2/N2mi/N2a, M0;

stage IVA: T4, any N, M0;

stage IVB: any T, any N, M1.
